mdl 1;
-- mendixlabs/mxcli#624 (ako/mxcli#1259) — CE0129 "Administrator password has
-- not been set" could only be resolved in Studio Pro: `alter app security` had
-- no AdminPassword property.
--
-- Measured on Mendix 11.13.0 (testdata/pedapp with AdminPassword blanked):
-- security level off, 0 extra errors; production, one extra error
--     [CE0129] "Administrator password has not been set." at Security
-- A password that violates the project's password policy ('1' against a
-- 12-character minimum) adds no error at any level.
--
-- After this script `mx check` reports the same errors as the untouched app,
-- and `describe app security` prints "Admin Password: set" (never the value).
-- Re-running it reports "Unchanged admin password".

alter app security ( SecurityLevel: production, AdminPassword: 'N3w-Admin-Passw0rd' );
